                                                "sense_id": "bac016fa-06db-3588-bcce-512d2f63ab75",
                                                "text": "\"We came on a wild-goose chase\", grumbled one, as he stirred the fire. \"Got nothing but a soaking for our pains\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c564edfb-f932-323e-9305-cda5d77ce05f",
                                        "entry_id": "b72deaf7-2109-3b39-81d3-803c2e4de045",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The practice of inserting a penis into a vagina and remaining stationary, without thrusting, supposedly used by some conservative Christians in lieu of traditional sexual intercourse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3b80c3b-4265-480b-8b51-ef4cfef6bb40",
                                                "sense_id": "c564edfb-f932-323e-9305-cda5d77ce05f",
                                                "text": "That's probably why everyone is already having anal sex in ninth grade. I mean, let's face it, even the Mormons are soaking."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3323002-05bc-4a24-ab3f-a3062b5c3254",
                                                "sense_id": "c564edfb-f932-323e-9305-cda5d77ce05f",
                                                "text": "Mormonism is a culture very much predicated on puritanical commitments […] the Amazon series Alpha House […] made much of Mormon soaking, an alternative sex practice engaged in by two LDS characters on the show. Soaking basically allows for penis-vagina penetration but absolutely no friction. Insertion is OK; pumping will send you to hell."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7df2c4d-42cc-4e97-a6f5-0fe8aa7a3f8b",
                                                "sense_id": "c564edfb-f932-323e-9305-cda5d77ce05f",
                                                "text": "This all-or-nothing attitude implies that penetration equal sex. (Although throngs of folks raised in abstinence-based religions might [take this view]. My favorite is the Mormon concept of \"soaking,\" which means a man sticks his penis in a vagina but doesn't move it around, therefore it somehow doesn't count as sex. Gimme a break.)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
